SUMMARY:Food Bank sort\, Saturday morning · Raleigh branch
LOCATION:Food Bank of Central & Eastern NC - Raleigh Branch\, 1924 Capital 
 Blvd\, Raleigh\, NC 27604 (volunteer entrance currently at 2439 Crabtree B
 lvd)
DESCRIPTION:Weekend food-sorting shift at the main Raleigh warehouse. Worki
 ng beside the same crews is an easy way to talk to people.\n\nThere's also
  a Saturday 1-3:30pm session\n\nHow to join: Online registration is requir
 ed: use the volunteer calendar on the Raleigh location page\n\nBefore you 
 go: Spots fill up\; book ahead\, especially in the holiday season.\n\nhttp
 s://foodbankcenc.org/locations/raleigh/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
