SUMMARY:Food sorting · Food 4 Thought
LOCATION:Food 4 Thought Raleigh\, Raleigh\, NC (exact address on the sign-u
 p listing)
DESCRIPTION:Help sort food for a Raleigh hunger-relief nonprofit during Hun
 ger & Homelessness Awareness Week. A 'Share it!' shift follows from 4:30 t
 o 6:30 PM the same day.\n\nHow to join: Sign up for 'Sort it!' from Food 4
  Thought Raleigh on volunteer.activategood.org (search for the title). Spo
 ts are limited.\n\nBefore you go: Each shift has only a few spots\; more d
 ates are posted on the same listing.\n\nhttps://volunteer.activategood.org
 /\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://volunteer.activategood.org/
