SUMMARY:Winterfaire volunteer\, Sunday · Moore Square
LOCATION:Moore Square\, 226 E Martin St\, Raleigh\, NC 27601
DESCRIPTION:Help run crafts\, lawn games and Santa activities on the last d
 ay of Moore Square Winterfaire\, a free downtown holiday festival with loc
 al vendors\, or help pack it all up.\n\nThree Sunday shifts: 9:30am–1:30
 pm (setup and activities)\, 1–5pm (activities) and 4:30–8:30pm (breakd
 own).\n\nHow to join: Create a free account in Raleigh Parks' CERVIS volun
 teer system and pick a Sunday shift under '2026 Moore Square Winterfaire E
 vent Support'.\n\nhttps://www.cervistech.com/acts/webreg/eventdetail.php?e
 vent_id=3397&org_id=0105\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
