SUMMARY:Share It! produce giveaway · Food 4 Thought\, Moore Square
LOCATION:Moore Square\, Moore Square\, Raleigh\, NC 27601
DESCRIPTION:Help Food 4 Thought load sorted produce\, set up the produce li
 ne in Moore Square and hand out fresh food to downtown neighbors\, then pa
 ck up what's left.\n\nEvening distribution shift that follows Food 4 Thoug
 ht's afternoon 'Sort it!' shift\; ages 18+.\n\nHow to join: Pick a Sunday 
 and sign up on Food 4 Thought's 'Share it!' timeslot through Activate Good
 's volunteer portal (free account).\n\nhttps://volunteer.activategood.org/
 timeslots/uHy4omHr2n\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://volunteer.activategood.org/timeslots/uHy4omHr2n
