SUMMARY:Pay-what-you-can cafe shift · A Place at the Table
LOCATION:A Place at the Table\, 300 W Hargett St\, Raleigh\, NC 27601
DESCRIPTION:Help run downtown Raleigh's pay-what-you-can cafe: greet guests
 \, run food and drinks\, bus tables and wash dishes alongside regulars and
  other volunteers.\n\n11am-2pm shift each date\; Dec 13 and Dec 20 also ha
 ve a 12-3pm shift\, and Dec 20 an 8-11am shift. Ages 15+.\n\nHow to join: 
 Sign up for a Sunday timeslot ('Community and Good Food for All!') on Acti
 vate Good's volunteer portal (free account).\n\nhttps://volunteer.activate
 good.org/timeslots/MmelKFTo6h\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://volunteer.activategood.org/timeslots/MmelKFTo6h
